enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133489158,imgsize-1562612.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[TikTok Mom Dies In Crash: creator ‘Mama A’ killed in 2-car wreck; GoFundMe aids 4 kids]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133484503.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Alyshia Rushing, known as TikTok’s “Mama A,” died at 26 after a two-vehicle crash in Montgomery, Alabama, on August 22. Police are investigating the crash, which also killed Landon Dunn. Rushing leaves four children, and a GoFundMe has been launched to support them and their father with daily needs, schooling, housing, childcare and counseling.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-happened-to-alyshia-rushing-mama-as-alabama-car-crash-death-leaves-four-children-fans-heartbroken/articleshow/133484503.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-happened-to-alyshia-rushing-mama-as-alabama-car-crash-death-leaves-four-children-fans-heartbroken/articleshow/133484503.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-25T05:20:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133484515,imgsize-690319.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owens Rebukes TPUSA Post: Candace Owens slams Tyler Bowyer; dispute over Erika Kirk]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133484239.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens has pushed back against TPUSA chief operating officer Tyler Bowyer after he compared the backlash faced by Erika Kirk with financial support for Lindsay Clancy. Owens criticized Turning Point USA’s handling of events following Charlie Kirk’s death, arguing that people can oppose fundraisers for Clancy while also believing TPUSA should stay out of the case. Her latest comments add another chapter to her ongoing public feud with Erika and TPUSA.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/erika-was-photographed-over-his-bloody-mic-candace-owens-fires-another-shot-at-erika-kirk-as-tyler-bowyers-lindsay-clancy-post-sparks-outrage/articleshow/133484239.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/erika-was-photographed-over-his-bloody-mic-candace-owens-fires-another-shot-at-erika-kirk-as-tyler-bowyers-lindsay-clancy-post-sparks-outrage/articleshow/133484239.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-25T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133484252,imgsize-597895.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Coercion and bullying won't work: Iran's message to US during Munir meet]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133486611.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iranian President Masoud Pezeshkian met Pakistan Army chief Asim Munir in Tehran. Pezeshkian urged the United States to change its approach towards Iran. He stressed that coercion and bullying complicate diplomatic efforts and hinder progress. Munir's visit occurred amid heightened regional tensions and US sanctions. Both leaders emphasized cooperation for regional peace and stability.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/must-correct-its-tone-irans-pezeshkian-warns-us-against-coercion-and-bullying-in-munir-meet/articleshow/133486611.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/must-correct-its-tone-irans-pezeshkian-warns-us-against-coercion-and-bullying-in-munir-meet/articleshow/133486611.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2